English normalization variants
==============================

`english.glm`
  Source: kaldi-asr/kaldi — egs/ami/s5/local/english.glm
  URL:    https://github.com/kaldi-asr/kaldi/blob/master/egs/ami/s5/local/english.glm
  License: Apache License 2.0 (Kaldi repository)
  Provenance: NIST RT evaluation English GLM scoring filter (en20040920.glm lineage),
              redistributed with Kaldi.

`englishNormalizationVariants.json`
  Derived locally from `english.glm` simple `A => B` rules (no invented mappings).
  Bidirectional equivalence classes only; special NIST tokens (%…) and bracketed
  alternate rules are excluded.

Regenerate the JSON with:
  npx tsx scripts/buildEnglishNormalizationVariants.ts
